{"data":{"title":"THINK 2WICE","slug":"think-2wice","path":"/artists/jusoul/tracks/think-2wice/","artwork":"images/artists/jusoul/tracks/think-2wice.jpg","artist":{"id":"qI_fhWLhyvA","slug":"jusoul","links":null,"title":"JuSoul","artwork":null},"id":"cfQal35H1o0"},"appearanceCount":5,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"LwP_Sjb3QYE","show":{"id":"5Xbl7MTHePo","slug":"172","title":"Soulection Radio Show #172 w/ Rhettmatic (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/172.jpg","content":"Rhettmatic of the legendary beat Junkies Crew graces us with a 50 minute set + an in depth interview. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nRhett is definitely one of the most humble guests we've had on here and is more connected than anyone really knows. Do yourself a favor and get mentally prepared to learn a lot. It's much more than just music. Shouts to Rhettmatic, Mr. Choc, J. Rocc, and the rest of the Beat Junkies crew. Also, big big up to Free The Robots for coming through the studio and vibing with us. Much love to you & the whole Crosby crew. Stay tuned for much more to come. Enjoy.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","published_at":"2014-04-26T01:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"BHPMqaG-PZA","show":{"id":"tG9uuDVmGUg","slug":"187","title":"Soulection Radio Show #187 w/ Sango","artwork":"/images/episodes/187.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-10-04T18:00:09+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"XpE941A1_VQ","show":{"id":"cgQYpogYRzc","slug":"204","title":"Soulection Radio Show #204 (Dilla Tribute)","artwork":"/images/episodes/204.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2015-02-08T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"fSoKj6o_d4A","show":{"id":"PhO0UJBiWkc","slug":"294","title":"Soulection Radio Show #294 (6 Years of Soulection)","artwork":"/images/episodes/294.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2017-01-28T00: